  "heading": "\\real.abs(x_)",
  "heading_latex": "\\textrm{absolute value of }x\\quad\\htmlClass{mlg-title-written}{\\left| x \\right|}",
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\real.abs(x_)]\nDefines: a is \\real\nexpresses:\n. piecewise:\n  if: x_ \\:real.geq?:/ \\real.zero\n  then: a = x_\n  else: a = \\real.neg(x_)\nDocumented:\n. called: \"absolute value of $x_?$\"\n. written: \"\\left| x_? \\right|\"\n. description: \"The absolute value $|x| = x$ if $x \\ge 0$ and $-x$ if $x < 0$.\"\nId: \"f75ee806-0ba7-4585-8183-d7f6355ed4cc\"",
